# The two names README.md tells an operator to build into this tracked directory (`go build -o
# liveprobe .`, and the arm64 cross build), and the Windows spelling: `go build` here on Windows
# writes liveprobe.exe, 36 MB. That binary was staged once, on 2026-09-17, before the core SDK's
# .gitignore named it, and stage 3's import needed a second git-filter-repo pass to strip it from
# this directory's history. Carried from the core SDK's .gitignore (urnetwork/sdk b8e0da26, lines
# 3-9), whose rules the sdk removal drops with the directory.
/liveprobe
/liveprobe-arm64
*.exe
